.TH UNIPROT 1 2000-1月 "uniprot_keywords" "uniprot_keywords"
.SH NAME
uniprot_keywords \- Create a gsea background model for uniprot keywords based
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIuniprot_keywords(\fBuniprot\fR as any, 
\fBdb_xref\fR as string = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Create a gsea background model for uniprot keywords based
 on the given uniprot database assembly data
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBuniprot\fB \fR\- 
 a collection of the UniProt protein [entry](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Assembly.Uniprot.XML.entry) data, or a file path of the
 UniProt database xml file.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdb_xref\fB \fR\- 
 the database cross reference name that will be used as the gene id of the background
 members, for example \fBGeneID\fR. Default \fBNULL\fR means using the UniProt accession id.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [Background](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.Background) model whose clusters are the UniProt keyword terms, or an
 error message when the input data could not be cast into the UniProt entry collection.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
UniProt
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
